                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Gnomoria is an old gem that is tragically little known for its quality. Unfortunately development ended in 2016 and the developer apparently retired from Gamedev afterwards: this is the final version. While there are flaws left behind by whatever lead to the early end of development, Gnomoria is still an incredibly fun Dwarf Fortress-like aimed at those interested in the genre, but leery of DF's infamously overcomplicated nature.",
